    "No PowerShell-related event was returned by the Sysmon search, but the endpoint collection gap prevents treating that as evidence that PowerShell did not run."
  ],
  "claims_not_established": [
    "Whether PowerShell ran on WS-DWELLS-01 around 13:40 UTC, and, if so, its command line, script, parent process, or initiating account.",
