    "Whether the Windows Update transfer was expected patching activity or caused the reported window.",
    "Whether the Google Drive File Stream process was authorized, active during the reported window, or transferred data.",
    "Whether malicious activity occurred, or whether WS-DWELLS-01 is otherwise free of compromise."
  ],
  "recommended_action": "collect_more",
  "additional_evidence_needed": [
    "Recover local endpoint or EDR telemetry for WS-DWELLS-01 from 13:30 to 14:10 UTC, including process creation, PowerShell Operational logs, script-block logging, and console history if available.",
    "Review Windows Update and patch-management logs for WS-DWELLS-01 around 13:40 UTC and confirm whether patching was initiated or authorized.",
    "Obtain DC-LV-01 SMB share-access auditing and relevant FILE-LV-01 logs to determine what the SMB session accessed and whether it relates to a script or remote execution.",
